# By its text the body of a loop of three turns does not stand on every way through a turn of the loop around it, and neither does a read under a condition: so the storage and the length of the lists
# read there were loaded anew at each read, though nothing in the turns writes them. The two are loads that never fail of what is a list by its own type: they stand in front.
